      },
      "text": "Bolivia in 11 days: Lake Titicaca, La Paz, Uyuni and Torotoro"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "1adfca000bdebd5a1fe39859e4cf2921bd10710c62158c52084b97d5f5d949f6",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-14e358aa-5c7e-4f7d-99e1-c711351eb01b",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "This itinerary brings together cities, high-altitude lakes, archaeological sites, the Uyuni Salt Flat, colourful lagoons and Torotoro National Park. Over 11 days, you will visit Santa Cruz, see Tiwanaku and Lake Titicaca, explore La Paz, cross the Uyuni Salt Flat and reach the Eduardo Avaroa Reserve before heading to Cochabamba and Torotoro."
    },
